<view wx:if="{{preferenceReady}}" class="page decision-page conditions-page {{themeClass}}">
  <view class="virtual-badge">虚拟体验</view>
  <view class="title">这顿的条件</view><view class="subtitle">预算、距离和口味，留下你在意的。</view>
  <button class="card origin-card" bindtap="location"><view class="origin-symbol">↗</view><view class="origin-content"><view class="origin-caption">虚拟出发点</view><view class="label">{{locationLabel}}</view></view><text class="origin-change">更换 ›</text></button>
  <view class="form-section-caption">01 · 这次想选什么</view>
  <view class="card target-card"><view class="chips target-chips"><button class="chip {{target === 'PACKAGE' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-target="PACKAGE" bindtap="target">一份套餐</button><button class="chip {{target === 'RESTAURANT' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-target="RESTAURANT" bindtap="target">一家餐厅</button></view></view>
  <view class="form-section-caption">02 · 基本条件</view>
  <view class="card limits-card">
    <view class="form-field"><view class="section-title">总价预算</view><view class="chips"><button wx:for="{{choices.budgetCents}}" wx:key="index" class="chip {{item.selected ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-key="budgetCents" data-index="{{item.index}}" bindtap="select">{{item.label}}</button></view></view>
    <view class="form-field"><view class="section-title">虚拟距离</view><view class="field-caption">仅用于场景内比较，不是现实路程</view><view class="chips"><button wx:for="{{choices.maxDistanceUnits}}" wx:key="index" class="chip {{item.selected ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-key="maxDistanceUnits" data-index="{{item.index}}" bindtap="select">{{item.label}}</button></view></view>
    <view class="form-field"><view class="section-title">辣度</view><view class="chips"><button wx:for="{{choices.maxSpicy}}" wx:key="index" class="chip {{item.selected ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-key="maxSpicy" data-index="{{item.index}}" bindtap="select">{{item.label}}</button></view></view>
    <view class="row toggle-row"><view><view class="label">只选模拟素食</view><view class="muted">依据虚拟场景中的模拟属性</view></view><switch checked="{{vegetarianOnly}}" data-key="vegetarianOnly" bindchange="toggle" color="#b94a29"/></view>
    <view wx:if="{{target === 'PACKAGE'}}" class="row toggle-row"><view><view class="label">优先模拟正餐</view><view class="muted">依据模拟用餐类型，具体配料和分量未知</view></view><switch checked="{{preferMain}}" data-key="preferMain" bindchange="toggle" color="#b94a29"/></view>
  </view>
  <view class="form-section-caption">03 · 这次更在意什么</view>
  <view class="card priorities-card"><view class="field-caption">越向右，比较候选时越看重这一项。</view><view wx:for="{{priorities}}" wx:key="key" class="priority"><view class="row"><text>{{item.label}}</text><text class="priority-value">{{item.value === 0 ? '不参考' : item.value === 6 ? '很在意' : item.value + ' / 6'}}</text></view><slider min="0" max="6" step="1" value="{{item.value}}" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindchange="priority" activeColor="#b94a29" block-size="20"/><view class="priority-scale"><text>不参考</text><text>很在意</text></view></view></view>
  <view class="virtual-note">条件变化后开始新一轮。未知信息会单独说明，虚拟距离不对应现实路线。</view>
  <view class="conditions-footer"><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view class="footer-note">仅用于本次选择，不会改写口味偏好</view><button class="primary" bindtap="submit">按这些条件决定</button></view>
</view>
